Bind Npc 31560 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31559 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 646 "Quick Delivery II"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Sailor] Armada."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Sailor] Keed."
    Collect 1 of 900195000

Requires player level >= 62 and quest 645 is completed

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    Say "Gosh, Master. That noisy person who looked for you last time is asking for you again. Get to the port at once."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Alas! There you are! So glad to see you!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I know it's such a sudden request, but please deliver something instead of me!! It's very urgent!! That bad fellow always leaves me with his work!! Here's the [Specialty Fruit Box] . . . Deliver this to . . . Who was that . . . ? Oh, yes, deliver this to a person called [Secret Agent] Clarence. Don't forget to bring the receipt!! Take care!\n\nOf Karus Regional Executive pugeo port sailors at the request of the Armada, bringing fruit box specially made for a secret agent Clarence, come take receipt of Clarence."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Alas! There you are! So glad to see you!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I know it's such a sudden request, but please deliver something instead of me!! It's very urgent!! That bad fellow always leaves me with his work!! Here's the [Specialty Fruit Box] . . . Deliver this to . . . Who was that . . . ? Oh, yes, deliver this to a person called [Secret Agent] Clarence. Don't forget to bring the receipt!! Take care!\n\nBringing fruit box specially made for a secret agent Clarence Elmo Shark rad area of the port in accordance with the request of Captain Kidd, come take receipt of Clarence."

On in_progress
    Say "Huh? Why are you still here? Hurry up!"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Phew...one complete. Thank you!\n\nAlas. I can't just sit by and let him tease me continuously. I need you to take revenge on that [Sailor] Hayes for me . . . Oh! I got it! Ha-ha-ha-ha! Collect [Teeth of Undying] and give them to that fellow. You'll be able to collect them while you're catching [Undyings]. Let me see him getting frightened!"
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Phew...one complete. Thank you!\n\nAlas. I can't just sit by and let him tease me continuously. I need you to take revenge on that [Sailor] Hein for me . . . Oh! I got it! Ha-ha-ha-ha! Collect [Teeth of Undying] and give them to that fellow. You'll be able to collect them while you're catching [Undyings]. Let me see him getting frightened!"

On completed
    Say "Come back later when you reach Lv63, okay?"
